# hanoi.ipynb, Icon entry (scrip-icon): cells 0 the title (markdown), 1 globals and setup, 2 move and hanoi, 3 main; THE DRIVER NUMBERS run BY EVERY CELL (run 1, 2, 3) and break and the expected cell BY CODE CELL (0 globals and setup, 1 move and hanoi, 2 main). developer_09 2026-11-22. EXPECTED by the program, never copied from a reading: the frame waiting at a call is on the call's line; a step in enters the callee at its first statement; a step out stops in the caller at the next statement after the call; a value in Icon's image (a string in double quotes). The first hit of line 10 is the move of disk 1, three calls down: main (cell 2 line 4) calls hanoi(3) which calls hanoi(2) on line 9 which calls hanoi(1) on line 9 which calls move on line 10. Cells 1 and 2 are run first, as a person runs a notebook from the top; neither prints.
